## Proposed Changes

---

### Phase 1 — Data Model

All exam content lives in a static typed file — no backend required.

#### [NEW] lib/exam/examLibrary.ts

Core TypeScript types for the entire exam system:

- `ExamName`: `'IELTS Academic' | 'IELTS General' | 'TOEFL iBT'`
- `TaskName`: `'Task 1' | 'Task 2' | 'Integrated' | 'Academic Discussion'`
- `QuestionType`: covers all IELTS Task 1 visuals, all IELTS Task 2 essay types, and TOEFL types
- `ExamPrompt`: the main content interface including:
  - Hierarchy fields (`exam`, `task`, `questionType`)
  - Filter fields (`tags`, `targetWordCount`)
  - Briefing Room fields (`promptText`, optional `promptImageUrl`, optional `promptAudioUrl`, `toeflReadingPassage`, `toeflStudentReplies`)
  - Copywork target (`sampleAnswer`)
  - Post-match fields (`scoringNotes`, `highlightedVocab: AnnotatedWord[]`, `highlightedStructures: AnnotatedSpan[]`)
- `AnnotatedWord`: `{ word, cefr: 'C1'|'C2', explanation }`
- `AnnotatedSpan`: `{ phrase, label, explanation }`

#### [NEW] lib/exam/examData.ts

Static array of `ExamPrompt` objects seeded with:
- **IELTS Academic Task 1**: 3 samples (Line Graph, Bar Chart, Map)
- **IELTS Academic Task 2**: 5 samples (one per essay type)
- **IELTS General Task 2**: 2 samples
- **TOEFL Task 2 (Academic Discussion)**: 2 samples
- **TOEFL Task 1 (Integrated)**: 2 text-only stubs (audio deferred)

Total: ~14 fully annotated prompts to start.

---

### Phase 2 — Library Browser Page

#### [NEW] app/library/page.tsx

A drill-down browser UI with 3 filter levels:

```
Level 1 — Exam pill tabs:    [IELTS Academic] [IELTS General] [TOEFL iBT]
Level 2 — Task sub-tabs:     [Task 1]  [Task 2]
Level 3 — Question type chips: [Line Graph] [Bar Chart] [Agree/Disagree] …
                               ↓
Grid of ExamPromptCard components
```

Each `ExamPromptCard` shows:
- Question type badge (e.g. `LINE GRAPH`)
- Truncated prompt question text
- Tag pills (`#Band_9`, `#Technology`)
- Word count pill
- `→ Start Practice` CTA

Added to Navbar as **Library** between Studio and Coach.

---

### Phase 3 — Briefing Room

#### [NEW] app/library/[promptId]/page.tsx

Two-column layout on ≥md, stacked on mobile.

**Left column — The Prompt:**
- Breadcrumb: `IELTS Academic > Task 2 > Agree/Disagree`
- Full exam question in a styled card
- Chart/map image if `promptImageUrl` is set
- TOEFL Task 2: professor prompt + student A & B replies in a classroom-style thread UI
- TOEFL Task 1: text-only reading passage + lecture summary

**Right column — Sample Answer Preview:**
- Renders `sampleAnswer` with `highlightedVocab` words underlined in amber with tooltip
- `highlightedStructures` spans in violet with tooltip
- `scoringNotes` callout block (emerald border)
- Large **`Start Typing Practice →`** button

**CTA**: calls `studioStore.loadText(prompt.sampleAnswer, prompt.id)` + sets `activePromptId`, then navigates to `/library/[promptId]/session`.

---

### Phase 4 — Exam Session Page

#### [NEW] app/library/[promptId]/session/page.tsx

Reuses `SessionHUD` and `TypingCanvas` unchanged. Differences:
- Header breadcrumb shows exam context
- Exit goes back to `/library/[promptId]` (Briefing Room)
- On completion renders `ExamResultCard` instead of the generic `ResultCard`

---

### Phase 5 — Post-Match Analysis Panel

#### [NEW] components/typing/ExamResultCard.tsx

**Section 1 — Typing Performance** (same as current `ResultCard`)
WPM · Accuracy · Time · Typos

**Section 2 — Vocabulary You Practiced**
Grid of vocab cards per `AnnotatedWord`: word in large font, `C1`/`C2` CEFR badge, explanation. Styled in amber tones.

**Section 3 — Grammar Structures You Used**
List of `AnnotatedSpan` entries: phrase, structure label, explanation. Styled in violet tones.

**Section 4 — Why This Answer Scores Highly**
`scoringNotes` as a coach-style callout with emerald border.

**Action buttons:**
- `Retry This Prompt` → resets session
- `Back to Briefing Room` → `/library/[promptId]`
- `Browse More Prompts` → `/library`

---

### Phase 6 — Store & History Integration

#### [MODIFY] store/studioStore.ts

Add `activePromptId: string | null` to state (set when loading an exam prompt, cleared on free-form upload).

#### [MODIFY] lib/db/types.ts

Add optional `promptId?: string` field to `StudioHistoryRecord` to distinguish exam sessions from free-form uploads in profile history.

#### [MODIFY] app/profile/page.tsx

Add a small exam badge to history cards that have a `promptId` — e.g. `IELTS Task 2` tag pill next to the session title.

---

### Phase 7 — Navigation

#### [MODIFY] components/Navbar.tsx

Add **Library** nav link between Studio and Coach:
`Studio | Library | Coach | Profile`

